# Bfxr MCP

Never play audio. The user always plays sounds themselves in the library web app.

- Do not call `play_sound`
- Do not set `play: true` or `embed_audio: true` on `generate_sound` or `mutate_sound`
- After `generate_sound` or `mutate_sound`, refresh the library in Cursor Simple Browser / Browser pane at `http://localhost:4747` (run `npm run web` first if it is not up)
- Report file paths and permalinks; do not play the files
